{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42302","headline":"和尉迟赞善病中见寄 · 徐铉","name":"和尉迟赞善病中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎移病暑天过，却似冥鸿避罻罗。\n昼梦乍惊风动竹，夜吟时觉露沾莎。\n情亲稍喜贫居近，性嬾犹嫌上直多。\n望苑恩深期勿药，青云岐路未蹉跎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}